        {
          "say": "swim, swim, swim",
          "lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "laser": "c1b"
        },
        {
          "say": "例子二：原地快快跑，一边跑一边说。"
        },
        {
          "say": "run fast, run fast, run fast",
          "lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "say": "你也试一试：用力往上跳，说跳得高。"
        },
        {
          "say": "jump high, jump high",
